# JOURNEY · zen: /zen hides the command bar, the stats and every label, and leaves the tank and its
# fishes; the tank grows over the rows the bars gave up. Any key press brings them back, and that key
# types nothing. Speech bubbles still show (tests/zen.rs).

run /zen
absent Fishtank
snap zen: the tank and its fishes, nothing else
key esc
release esc
expect Fishtank
snap one key and the bars come back
type /zen
key enter
release enter
absent Fishtank
key q
expect Fishtank
snap q wakes it too, and quits nothing
